Redesign: glassmorphism + Prussian Blue / Butter Yellow palette

Replace the orange-and-black theme with a glassmorphism design using Prussian Blue (#003153) surfaces and Butter Yellow (#FBE77A) accents.

- globals.css: new CSS design tokens (prussian blue surface hierarchy, butter yellow accent), glass-card / glass-strong / glass-pill utilities with backdrop-blur + saturate, updated gradient-text, hero-mesh, scrollbar, selection, and light-mode overrides
- layout.tsx: body bg #021B30, theme-color #003153, footer border-white/10
- Header.tsx: glassmorphic sticky header with backdrop-blur-xl, butter yellow accent badge, white/5 controls
- app/page.tsx: hero with butter yellow gradient text, glass-card feature cards, glass-pill trust pills, prussian blue decorative blurs
- AskInput.tsx + StickyAsk.tsx: glass search bar with butter yellow CTA and focus ring
- BotAvatar.tsx + bot-avatar.svg: prussian blue avatar surface, butter yellow pulse/accent
- Chat.tsx: glass cards for saved/history/empty-state, butter yellow tab indicator + user bubbles + CTA, glass-pill suggestion chips, prussian blue input bar with backdrop-blur
- AnswerCard.tsx: all orange-500 -> butter yellow, zinc-900/950/800 -> white/5 + backdrop-blur glass surfaces, text-zinc-950 -> #0A2540 on butter yellow buttons
- EmergencyModal.tsx: glass-strong modal container, white/5 controls, prussian blue inset surfaces
- StepTrackerModal.tsx: prussian blue fullscreen bg, glass controls, butter yellow step number + next button
- manifest.webmanifest: theme_color #003153, background_color #021B30

